# ReadRealm - Environment Configuration Guide
#
# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Configuration files are located in specific directories:
#
# 1. Backend API Configuration:
#    → Location: apps/api/.env
#    → Template: apps/api/.env.example
#    → Copy: cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#
# 2. Shared Configuration Reference:
#    → Location: shared/config/.env.example
#    → This file documents all available environment variables
#
# 3. Docker Configuration (Optional):
#    If using docker-compose, create .env at project root with:
#    → MONGODB_URL, JWT_SECRET, and API keys as needed
#    → docker-compose.yaml will use these values
#
# See shared/config/.env.example for complete variable reference

